---
# ROS 2 standard C++ style. Chosen because the existing hand-written C++ in
# omniman_commander/ and omniman_hand_teleop/ is already close to it: this
# setting reformats ~840 lines, whereas Google/4-space/150-col would churn
# ~2570 (essentially a full rewrite of every file).
#
# Note: cybergear_hardware/ ships its own .clang-format (Google/4/150). That
# does not conflict, because clang-format resolves the nearest config walking
# up from each file, and cybergear_hardware/ is vendored and excluded from
# the pre-commit hooks entirely.
BasedOnStyle: Google
IndentWidth: 2
ColumnLimit: 100
